      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a lively, blurred scene of people dancing at a gay club, with the text overlay stating, 'went gay clubbing with some friends turns out out they were expecting something very different.' The scene is energetic and celebratory, with individuals raising their hands and enjoying the atmosphere. There is no visible toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging. The meme's intent is to humorously convey a situation where friends had unrealistic expectations about a gay clubbing experience, likely implying that the actual experience was more vibrant or intense than anticipated. The overall intent is lighthearted and comedic, using the juxtaposition of the text with the energetic visual to create a relatable and amusing scenario. No abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements are present.",
